            <div xml:id="d1135">

                <pb facs="1159" n="1149" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1149"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/10–1549: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-15T16:00:00+08:00">October 15, 1949—4
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 15—5:42 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4352. SS <hi rendition="#italic">Flying Trader</hi> sailed from Shanghai October
                    15 at 15405 for Taku Bar. Master’s orders from Isbrandtsen, New York, to answer
                    no signal from Chinese warships and continue course unless a shot fired across
                    bow.</p>
                <p>Sent Department, repeated Hong Kong 314, Taipei 377.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
